      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "I suspect this probably has to change https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-dom-interfaces.html#reflecting-content-attributes-in-idl-attributes as well.\r\n\r\nAlso, I had a brief look at the tests, but they don't look exhaustive. I had expected some kind of loop over all the features we want to test and whether they should have this behavior or not and then create a test for each of them.",
